T Modular gantry
# Designed as one module placed four times, not as one long list of parts.
# Every tower is identical; only where it sits changes. The ports say where the deck attaches,
# and the checker tells you whether a rod actually spans the gap between two of them.
X payload 0,0,0.6 90,90,45 #3B4252 mass=120
MOD tower
  C foot W8 0,0,0.5 x y
  C mid  W8 0,0,1.5 x y
  C top  B7 0,0,2.5 x y
  C top2 B7 0,0,2.5 z x
  R foot mid
  R mid top
  Z top2 deck
  Z mid brace
END
! four towers, one module placed four times
USE tower SW at=-2,-2,0
USE tower SE at=2,-2,0
USE tower NE at=2,2,0
USE tower NW at=-2,2,0
! the deck the ports were waiting for: 4 U between towers, so red rods
R SW.top2 SE.top2
R SE.top2 NE.top2
R NE.top2 NW.top2
R NW.top2 SW.top2
R SW.top2 NE.top2
! braces down the sides, in the vertical planes the towers already live in
R SW.mid SE.mid
R NW.mid NE.mid
